Z||000000||Flamberge||11-02-2001||04:14 PM||||I had just picked up my wife from work so we could have lunch, and I pulled up to the light where a 4th Gen (about a 85 I would guess) 'Vette was there. Good shape too. I looked at my wife and said "Too bad I haven't done an engine swap, or I would race him." Then the light turned green, and I ambled off the line, not trying, and saw that niether was he. So I punched it and left him in the dust, saying "hey I just got my first vette kill!"   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Its a darn good thing for me he wasn't trying. (I know it doesn't count as a kill, but makes a funny story.)<P><P>------------------<BR>- Flamberge<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://flamberge.iwarp.com/Serra3sm.jpg"> ||||reg||12
