Z||000005||MR2KLR||11-02-2001||07:06 PM||||I killed a ZR1 once abou a year ago I was going down a local 3-lane highway in the center lane and I se it bright red I see the ZR1 badge reflect off the sun he is geting on the high way (still on the ramp) behind a huge dump truck, I'm going like 85 and he darts over right in frint of me and I dart over into the left lane and blow by him I look in the rear view and the the look on her face it was a look of "OMG where did that come from" she didn't even se me before she came over she was like 60+ yrs old and in shock I had to get of on the next exit so I did and then saw her pass me and looking right at me like I was the devil or something. oen hell-of-a kill don't you think?||||reg||1
